From 535d3bcb16381d86109e172e5565acffebb1bd09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stew Forster <stew675@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 22:17:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 22/23] ggml : fp8 get_rows + single-copy fp8 token_embd, same
 speed, -22% file

token_embd is now F8_E4M3 with per-row scales and output.weight is gone
(one embedding serves lookup and lm_head via the tied-embedding fallback).
New fp8 get_rows kernel (CUDA k_get_rows_f8 + CPU via traits->to_float =
dequantize_row_f8_e4m3); the CPU supports_op carve-out for GET_ROWS is
required, otherwise the scheduler copies the whole 625 MB embedding into
the GPU compute buffer per batch (decode 5x slower). File 5.35 -> 4.17
GiB, pp512/tg64 unchanged, PPL 6.2250, generation matches.

Assisted-by: DeepSeek-V4
